### Buscar todos los pagos de un turno
GET http://localhost:3000/payments/25513b9c-c111-4727-8a0a-94e430047153

### Agregar un pago (por ejemplo $1500)
POST http://localhost:3000/payments/25513b9c-c111-4727-8a0a-94e430047153
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1500
}

### Eliminar el último pago
DELETE http://localhost:3000/payments/25513b9c-c111-4727-8a0a-94e430047153
